{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115133","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115133/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115133/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115133/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115133","id":3830452125,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6-C9_P","number":115133,"title":"Fix FileDialog inconsistent OK button state by keeping it always enabled","user":{"login":"skiessq","id":66063792,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MDYzNzky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66063792?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiessq","html_url":"https://github.com/skiessq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiessq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiessq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiessq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiessq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiessq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiessq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiessq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiessq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiessq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","color":"447744","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-01-19T16:32:48Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T16:06:58Z","closed_at":"2026-07-22T13:48:42Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115133","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115133","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115133.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115133.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes #115106\r\nThis PR fixes several inconsistent and confusing states in FileDialog where the OK button (Open/Save) could be disabled even when the dialog could be accepted, or enabled when acceptance was not possible.\r\n\r\nThis resulted in contradictory situations such as:\r\n\r\n- OK button disabled while Enter still accepts\r\n- OK button enabled but clicking it does nothing\r\n- No file selected but a valid path in the text field: Enter works, OK disabled\r\n\r\nTo resolve this, the OK button is now always enabled, matching the behavior of native file dialogs on Windows, macOS, and Linux.\r\n**All validation continues to be handled in _action_pressed(), exactly as before.**\r\n\r\nThis makes the dialog consistent, predictable, and easier to use.\r\n\r\nWhy this change:\r\n\r\n- Eliminates inconsistent UI states\r\n- Aligns with native dialog UX\r\n- Prevents regressions caused by mismatched validation paths\r\n- Keeps all acceptance logic intact and unchanged\r\n\r\nWhat was changed:\r\n- Removed calls to _is_open_should_be_disabled()\r\n- Replaced them with get_ok_button()->set_disabled(false)\r\n- _is_open_should_be_disabled() is no longer used\r\n\r\nTesting:  \r\nTested manually on Windows 11 with Godot 4.6 RC:\r\n\r\n1. Open File\r\n2. Open Files\r\n3. Open Folder\r\n4. Save File\r\n5. Manual path entry\r\n6. Invalid paths\r\n7. Hidden files\r\n\r\nAll behaviors are consistent and no regressions were found.","closed_by":{"login":"skiessq","id":66063792,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MDYzNzky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66063792?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiessq","html_url":"https://github.com/skiessq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiessq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiessq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiessq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiessq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiessq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiessq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiessq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiessq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiessq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115133/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115133/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}